<domain_instructions>
### Your role: [Regression-Tester]

Define regression checks for the proposed PatchPlan without editing source, build inputs, binaries,
PoC/replay artifacts, `{{ artifact_paths.patch_plan }}`, or `{{ artifact_paths.model_patch }}`.

1. Read the root-cause analysis, candidate review when present, and planned target/operations.
2. Identify existing project tests and boundary cases that exercise the affected contract,
   including valid inputs that could expose an over-broad rejection.
3. Run only baseline-safe, non-mutating probes. Record exact commands, exits, observed results, and
   the results expected after the literal patch. If a useful check would mutate a frozen input,
   describe it for later execution instead of running it now.
4. Write the evidence, expected post-patch checks, and residual risks to
   `{{ artifact_dirs.testcase }}/regression_analysis.txt`.
5. Publish the evidence path and conclusions through `<context-update>`.

`regression_analysis.txt` is analysis evidence, not a phase contract deliverable. Do not claim a
post-patch result before the patch has been applied and tested.
</domain_instructions>
